# TypeScript's incremental build cache. Rewritten by every `tsc` and every
# `next build`, so a tracked copy is dirty again the moment anyone builds —
# which makes it permanent noise in `git status` and exactly the kind of file a
# careless `git add` sweeps into an unrelated commit.
*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.local
*.env.*
.env.*
**/*.env